aux_grating
#
# This file contains the lookup tables calibrating grating cell tilt
# angle into motor steps. A lookup table is used because the calibration
# can be non-linear and include a sinusoidal element. Cell numbers 1,2,3,4
# are the same as cells A,B,C,D. 65 degrees is the zero order reflection
# angle.
#

# Grating A translation table (based on Marc Dubbeldam's report)
# NOTE: These figures are based on Marc's orientation A measurement
# corrected using the offset measured by Rick Murowinski on 24 May 2000
# corrected again using the offset measured by Stephanie Juneau on 28 June 2000
# corrected again using the offset measured by Stephanie Juneau on 13 Feb 2001
# Cell  Tilt    Steps

1   0.0000000       0
1   7.784         882.5
1  26.049        2810.5
1  40.222        4306.5
1  52.916        5646.5
1  65.000        6922
1  77.088        8198
1  89.750        9534.5

# Grating R831 in position B
# Grating B translation table (based on Marc Dubbeldam's report).
# NOTE: These figures are based on Marc's orientation A measurement
# corrected using the offset measured by Rick Murowinski on 24 May 2000
# corrected again using the offset measured by Stephanie Juneau on 28 June 2000
# corrected again using the offset measured by Stephanie Juneau on 13 Feb 2001
# updated for grating R831 by Isobel Hook on 17 December 2001, by adding 23.3 to all step values
# except 0,0

# Cell  Tilt    Steps

2   0.0000000       0
2   7.755         877
2  26.016        2804
2  40.226        4304
2  52.902        5642
2  65.000        6919
2  77.060        8192
2  89.741        9531

# Grating R400 in position C
# corrected using the offset measured by Isobel Hook on July 13 2001
# (for grating R400 in position C, 65 degrees corresponds to 6939steps)
# Cell  Tilt    Steps

3   0.0000000       0
3   7.760         897
3  26.016        2824
3  40.226        4324
3  52.888        5660.5
3  65.000        6939
3  77.074        8213.5
3  89.741        9550.5

# Grating D translation table (based on Marc Dubbeldam's report).
# NOTE: These figures are based on Marc's orientation A measurement
# corrected using the offset measured by Rick Murowinski on 24 May 2000
# corrected again using the offset measured by Stephanie Juneau on 28 June 2000
# corrected again using the offset reported by Isobel Hook on 17 January 2001
# corrected again using the offset measured by Stephanie Juneau on 13 Feb 2001
#
# Grating B600:
# Values for B600 in position 4 are
# Based on measurement of only the 65deg point, July 10, 2001  (IJ, IMH)
# The rest are offset 6984-6953=31 relative to R831 in cell 4 (D); (0,0) is left in place
# Cell  Tilt    Steps

4   0.0000000       0
4   7.755         910.5
4  26.025        2840
4  40.231        4338.5
4  52.912        5677
4  65.000        6953
4  77.069        8227
